{"id": "EUVD-2026-27643", "enisaUuid": "b7b7af51-c2f7-3e8a-9022-17d5210fed21", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nbtrfs: tracepoints: get correct superblock from dentry in event btrfs_sync_file()\n\nIf overlay is used on top of btrfs, dentry->d_sb translates to overlay's\nsuper block and fsid assignment will lead to a crash.\n\nUse file_inode(file)->i_sb to always get btrfs_sb.", "datePublished": "2026-05-06T07:40:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T19:06:14", "baseScore": 9.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4a7bab35fad5251c8cb738161152578cd83b6b9c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/520e8b4bcf872a534a7bf61ccf880047642df296", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e252db8ca2a01f82d472091f35d549b313278636", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c09a7446aab5773f38d6abb25fce99b8e1dfbc97", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/32372781d664a9b03c40343e96c29d0a6139f97d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2e4adfaec97ee053ad1bdfb5036845e66f7e0d8a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d110d7cdb045715c0b45b0dfd974525bb38f653d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a85b46db143fda5869e7d8df8f258ccef5fa1719"], "aliases": ["GHSA-8r24-mq27-r6cw", "CVE-2026-43117"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.46, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0f42b6d4-43cc-3c40-82e5-faf2db0927b6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "bc074524e123ded281cde25ebc5661910f9679e3 <2e4adfaec97ee053ad1bdfb5036845e66f7e0d8a"}, {"id": "3f07d1cb-6fdc-3ff6-940b-d22b2d912bb8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "bc074524e123ded281cde25ebc5661910f9679e3 <d110d7cdb045715c0b45b0dfd974525bb38f653d"}, {"id": "42f248f4-ac59-338d-9845-ad7cdda1cc3f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "701cec90-298c-3914-b2d7-fbe3a1c396a8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vend